---
---

<section id="about" class="section-padding">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Design feature side -->
      <div class="relative animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="relative rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 lg:p-10">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-[var(--accent-cyan)]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--accent-cyan)] mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Website Design That Fits Your Brand</h3>
            <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We design and build from scratch to reflect your identity, not another repurposed theme. Clean layout, purposeful typography, and fluid interactions across mobile and desktop.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/5">
              <div>
                <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Tailored Structure</p>
                <p class="text-[var(--text-dim)] text-xs">Built for your specific content and goals</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-white text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Manageable Content</p>
                <p class="text-[var(--text-dim)] text-xs">Easy to maintain as your business evolves</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text side -->
      <div class="animate-on-scroll delay-100">
        <p class="text-[var(--accent-cyan)] text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">About Us</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
          Clear Communication.<br />
          <span class="text-[var(--accent-cyan)]">Thoughtful Websites.</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-cyan)] pl-6 mb-8 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            At Glickages, we build websites that give businesses and organisations a dependable, professional presence on the web. Rather than forcing your brand into generic templates, we craft interfaces around your goals, audience, and content.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
            Whether you need a focused landing page, a comprehensive organizational website, or a clean blog with straightforward content editing, we prioritize clear communication, responsive performance, and code that is built to last.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/work"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--accent-cyan)] font-medium hover:text-[var(--accent-bright)] transition-colors group"
        >
          View Selected Work
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
